   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 Herald unit.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Greater Daemon unit.\n- Either a Greater Daemon, Daemon Prince or a Herald must be your Warlord.\n\nBenefit\n\n- Place on the board 3 Warp Portal Markers during deployment. Daemon units that arrive via Deep Strike wholly within 12\" of a Warp Portal Marker never scatter.\n- You may include 1 additional HQ, Troops, Fast Attack, Elites and Heavy Support choice for every 1000pts.\n- You may field Daemon Brutes as Troops choices.",
